# Otterball Antics: "If this spell was cast from anywhere other than your hand, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature." A copy of the spell
# was never cast (CR 707.10), so it has no zone it was cast from. Bot1 casts Antics from the hand and copies it with Fork: the original
# makes a plain 1/1 Otter, and so does the copy (a second 1/1, not a 2/2). Neither gets a counter.

